  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guide 100 US Veterans/Spouses To Rewarding Careers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annually, Hire Heroes USA serves the employment needs of thousands of unemployed/underemployed veterans, active-duty service members transitioning out of the military, and their job-seeking spouses/caregivers. We provide 1:1 career coaching, resume and interview assistance, expert mentorship, connections to employers and jobs, and wraparound referrals, significantly improving the employability of our nation&apos;s heroes and placing them on a pathway toward upward mobility and greater opportunity.</narrative>
  </description>
